questions.explanation:
Why This Is Asked
- Tests ability to align multiple teams around reliability goals and execute a concrete improvement plan
- Evaluates strategic thinking around ownership, telemetry standardization, and scalable incident response

Key Concepts
- Cross-team ownership matrices, telemetry contracts, SLIs/SLOs, incident runbooks, kill switches, reliability drills

Code Example
```javascript
// telemetry contract example
const serviceSLIs = {
  Auth: { latencyP95: 200, errorRate: 0.01 },
  Payments: { latencyP95: 300, errorRate: 0.01 },
  Search: { latencyP95: 250, errorRate: 0.01 },
  Messaging: { latencyP95: 220, errorRate: 0.01 }
};
```

